      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17428\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qmath.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17428\u0026quot;,180)\"\u003e and then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17429\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e to select the \u003cb\u003eSolver\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
